tsrs-only: visibility changes for the effect-tsgo shim accessors internal/typeparser calls (no Go counterpart: the
Go shim reaches these unexported checker methods through extra-shim.json linknames). Each item only changes
`pub(crate)` to `pub`:

- Checker::evaluate_entity (Checker_evaluateEntity), Checker::is_constant_variable (Checker_isConstantVariable),
  Checker::is_block_scoped_name_declared_before_use (Checker_isBlockScopedNameDeclaredBeforeUse):
  TypeParser.EvaluateConstantExpression.
- Checker::new_function_type (Checker_newFunctionType), Checker::new_call_signature (Checker_newCallSignature):
  typeparser.DerivePipeableSignatureFromDataFirst.
- Checker::push_contextual_type, pop_contextual_type, get_effective_call_arguments, get_this_type_of_signature,
  get_this_argument_type, get_this_argument_of_call, check_expression_cached, new_inference_context, infer_types,
  get_mapper_from_context, get_single_call_signature, get_or_create_type_from_signature,
  get_signature_instantiation_without_filling_in_type_arguments, instantiate_type, and mapper::new_type_mapper
  (checker.NewTypeMapper, exported in Go): the object literal contextual type replays of
  internal/typeparser/object_literal_contextual_type.go.
- Checker::get_global_promise_type_checked (Go's getGlobalPromiseTypeChecked resolver field),
  Checker::is_reference_to_type (Checker_isReferenceToType): TypeParser.PromiseType.
- for_each_yield_expression (checker.ForEachYieldExpression, exported in Go), re-exported from the crate root:
  TypeParser.ExecutionFlow.

